 PowerOn
 choice←0
 :Repeat
     ⎕←'================================'
     ⎕←'  Digital Date Marker for Coffee Shops and Restaurants'
     ⎕←'================================'
     ⎕←'1. One Day'
     ⎕←'2. Two Days'
     ⎕←'3. Three Days'
     ⎕←'4. Foccacia'
     ⎕←'5. Thirty Days'
     ⎕←'6. Thirty Days-Custom Date'
     ⎕←'7. Custom Date'
     ⎕←'8. Bryggkaffe'
     ⎕←'9. Frapino'
     ⎕←'0. Power off'


     choice←⎕

     :Select choice

     :Case 1
         One
         ⎕←'This function prints one day duration of the product.'
         ⎕←''

     :Case 2
         Two
         ⎕←'This function prints two days duration of the product.'
         ⎕←''

     :Case 3
         Three
         ⎕←'This function prints three days duration of the product.'
         ⎕←''

     :Case 4
         Foccacia
         ⎕←''

     :Case 5
         Thirty
         ⎕←'This function prints thirty days duration of the product.'

     :Case 6
         ⎕←'Enter your custom date ( year, month, day) and it will print thirty days duration of the product.'
         (y m d)←⎕
         ThirtyCustomDate(y m d)
         ⎕←''

     :Case 7
         ⎕←'Enter the number of days for the product duration. Must be less or equal 30'
         n←⎕
         ⎕←'Now enter the custom date (year, month, day) to calculate the product expiration date'
         (y m d)←⎕
         n CustomDate(y m d)
         ⎕←''

     :Case 8
         Bryggkaffe
         ⎕←'This function prints the production time of the filter coffee and its expiration time (hourly).'
         ⎕←''

     :Case 9
         Frapino






     :Case 0
         ⎕←'Power off!'
     :Else
         ⎕←'Invalid input'
     :EndSelect
 :Until choice=0
